# The OS versions since the last one in the published AvailabilityVersions
# (its availability.dsl ends at the fall 2023 updates: macOS 14.3, iOS
# 17.3), appended to that file by scripts/sdk/build_sdk.sh before it generates
# Availability.h & co. Only the version list: the release sets ("set" lines)
# feed dyld's private version map, which the SDK does not ship.
#
# Same format as availability.dsl ("version <platform> <version>").
